 TEST, the input test of each switch can be set. \u00a9 In the setting of the GAME FEE, number of coin and credit can be set for each coin slot, 1 and 2. \u00a9 To go out from the TEST MODE, make the DIP SWITCH 2 turn off, then follow the instructions displayed for further operation."},{"k":"tr","t":"KANEKO CO.,LTD.   \u2014   KANEKO USA, LTD."},{"k":"h","t":"8-23-21, Shakujiidai, Kk. Ne 1370 Busch Parkway"},{"k":"h","t":"Nerima-ku Tokyo 177, \u00ae \u2014 Buffalo Grove, IL60089"},{"k":"p","t":"Japan. Tel (708) 808-1370 | Tel(03)3921-9715 Fax (708)808-1375 eae"}]}